
We are launching Tiago Nav2 with:
ros2 launch tiago_2dnav tiago_nav_bringup.launch.py is_public_sim:=false rviz:=True slam:=True

we find the said launcher in the folder: tiagoworkspace/src/tiago_navigation/tiago_2dnav/launch

here we see that for is_public_sim == False we launch: pal_navigation_cfg_bringup

we find the said launcher in the folder: tiagoworkspace/src/pal_navigation_cfg_public/pal_navigation_cfg_bringup/launch

here we see that we are loading parameters from: tiagoworkspace/src/pal_navigation_cfg_public/pal_navigation_cfg_params/params/{robot_name}_nav2.yaml

Beeing here {robot_name} pmb2 (CAN BE VERIFIED), we locate parameters in the file: tiagoworkspace/src/pal_navigation_cfg_public/pal_navigation_cfg_params/params/pmb2_nav2.yaml

Inside here, the parameters to be modified are:

